% Generate pdd/server/routes/config.py for local frontend service discovery.

Export router with prefix /api/v1/config and tag config.
CloudUrlResponse contains cloud_url: str, environment: str, cloud_enabled: bool.
GET /cloud-url uses CloudConfig.get_base_url and is_server_configured.
The URL is empty when unconfigured. PDD_ENV defaults to self-hosted with a URL, otherwise local.
Use module-level absolute imports and Pydantic models.
